"and exposes a subset of the ``vtkPoints`` API. The ``data`` property returns "
"a ``VTKPartitionedArray`` wrapping the per-leaf coordinate arrays, so "
"``composite.points.data`` is numpy-indexable in the same way ``dataset."
"points.data`` is for non-composite datasets."
